'' RUN: std/fs phase P3, the open-file handle -- OpenOptions validation, every create/open
'' disposition, append, positional IO that never moves the position, SetSize, Stat on the
'' handle, a closed File, a directory, the wrong access mode, locks between two Files and
'' between a File and a FileLock, handles not inherited unless asked, NoFollow, Copy and
'' ReadExact through a File, OpenTemp and a non-ASCII name.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/fs-p3.tiko -o tests/codegen/fsp3.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/fsp3.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fsp3.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
